    "harness_rationale": "Added timestamp-based categorization control to prevent memory bloating while preserving recency-critical context. Introduced logical consistency enforcement to reduce \"wrong answer\" errors from contradictory storage. Expanded structural requirements to force precise spatial/temporal encoding rather than relying on implicit inference. Maintained core principles but added operational guardrails proven effective in ablation tests on multi-stream benchmarks.",
